 "text": "Aviva\nClaims line: 029 9518 8685\n\n17 Nov 2026\n\nT Herbert and Y. Ostapchuk\n209 Canal Road\nExeter\nEX4 6LW\n\nOur ref: C-8549702\nPolicy number: 239-0728815-83\n\nDear Tina Herbert,\n\nClaim C-8549702 (storm damage)\n\nWe are sorry to hear about your loss. We understand that on 4 Oct 2026 roof tiles were dislodged and the fence panels blown down during Storm Darragh.\n\nYour claim has been registered under policy 239-0728815-83 and Judith Fuller will be handling it.\n\nTo help us progress your claim, please send us:\n- receipts or proof of ownership for any items claimed\n- the police crime reference number\n- photographs of the damage\n- a copy of any repair estimate\n\nYours sincerely,\n\nJudith Fuller\nClaims Handler\njudith.fuller@aviva.co.uk\nAviva\n",
